OL,3,GNEWSACalls for action to prevent A63
OL,4,Abridge strikes
OL,5,
OL,6,FCalls have been made for more to be
OL,7,Fdone to prevent bridge strikes, which
OL,8,Fhave led to severe delays on the A63 in
OL,9,FEast Yorkshire.
OL,11,FThe third incident in as many years at
OL,12,FDale Road bridge in Elloughton happened
OL,13,Fon Monday, with evening rush-hour
OL,14,Fcommuters inconvenienced.
OL,16,FGoole and Pocklington MP Sir David
OL,17,FDavis said the situation had become
OL,18,F"entirely intolerable", while local
OL,19,Fcouncillor Richard Meredith asked
OL,20,Fofficials if a sensor-driven warning
OL,21,Fsystem could be installed.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,384,380,200,160,0,100
